Chromium suspicious-site-reporter (Apache License 2.0)
------------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/chromium/suspicious-site-reporter

PhishGuard's engine/rules/site_signals.js implements three structural URL
warning signals based on the public descriptions: four or more labels below a
page's registrable domain, unusually long hostname labels, and known
link-shortener or redirect-chain hosts.

MetaMask eth-phishing-detect (DBAD v1.2)
----------------------------------------
https://github.com/MetaMask/eth-phishing-detect

PhishGuard's engine/rules/brand_match.js implements allowlist-first reversed
label suffix matching and a graded fuzzy brand-domain matcher. The implementation
uses bounded edit distance, homoglyph normalisation, subdomain/hyphen brand-token
injection, and TLD-swap detection. The brand dataset, weights, and thresholds
are maintained within this codebase.

jsQR v1.4.0 (Apache License 2.0)
--------------------------------
https://github.com/cozmo/jsQR

engine/detection/qr.js contains the unmodified jsQR v1.4.0 JavaScript QR decoder
used for local QR-code destination checks. Decoded HTTP(S) payloads are scored
by PhishGuard's verdict engine; jsQR does not provide PhishGuard's detection
rules. Its license is included at LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
